{#
  BeMart admin Member edit — EC-CUBE goMember (メンバー登録/編集).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Setting/System/member_edit.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Setting/System/member_edit.twig).

  Setting/System section, FORM/CRUD page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The
  markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim
  from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound.

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md):
  the Member resource (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Member.php) exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminMemberForm} as `body['form']`,
  pre-filled with the persisted row. The inputs render through that real
  form object:

    {{ form.input('name')|raw }}        <- real <input> w/ id/attrs/value
    {{ form.error('name') }}            <- inline Be-domain error, if any

  EC-CUBE renders the same inputs through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.name)`); Ray.WebFormModule is BeMart's
  BEAR-idiomatic equivalent. `AdminMemberForm::init()` ports the field
  names / ids / attributes from EC-CUBE's `MemberType` (block prefix
  `/admin/member`).

  VALIDATION AUTHORITY STAYS WITH the Be Framework Becoming chain — the
  form is a field-definition + renderer.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route)`         -> deterministic `/{route}` (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `form_widget(form.Authority)` (権限 entity select) -> BeMart renders
     the EC-CUBE mtb_authority options for create. Existing member edits
     keep authority read-only here; role flips use `/admin/authority-role`
     so the privilege-escalation guard remains observable.
   - `form_widget(form.Work)` (稼働 radio) -> likewise `work` is a bare
     int (mtb_work id) with no option set; the control is omitted. The
     稼働 row renders without an input. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `form.department` -> NOT carried by the MemberFetched projection
     (dtb_member.department out of the Wave 8 slice); the input renders
     empty. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - The `auto_render` entity-extension loop + `{% form_theme %}` ->
     Symfony form-theme / EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime. Dropped.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-member' %}
{% set title = 'メンバー登録' %}
{% set sub_title = 'システム設定' %}

{% block main %}
    {% set is_edit = loginId is defined and loginId %}
    <form name="member_form" role="form" id="member_form" method="post" action="{% if is_edit %}/admin/member?_method=put{% else %}/admin/member{% endif %}" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" id="member__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="mode" value="member_form">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8"><span class="card-title">メンバー登録</span></div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#memberInfo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="memberInfo">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="memberInfo">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>名前</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('name')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                            {% if form.error('name') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('name') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>所属</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('department')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                            {% if form.error('department') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('department') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>ログインID</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('loginId')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                            {% if form.error('loginId') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('loginId') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                {% if not is_edit %}
                                    <div class="row mb-2">
                                        <div class="col-3">
                                            <span>パスワード</span>
                                            <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col">
                                            <div class="row">
                                                <div class="col">
                                                    {{ form.input('password')|raw }}
                                                </div>
                                                {% if form.error('password') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('password') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row mb-2">
                                        <div class="col-3">
                                            <span>パスワード(確認)</span>
                                            <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col">
                                            <div class="row">
                                                <div class="col">
                                                    {{ form.input('passwordConfirm')|raw }}
                                                </div>
                                                {% if form.error('passwordConfirm') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('passwordConfirm') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="権限管理で設定した権限を選択できます。">
                                            <span>権限</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {% if is_edit %}
                                                    {{ authority is same as(0) ? 'システム管理者' : '店舗オーナー' }}
                                                {% else %}
                                                    {{ form.input('authority')|raw }}
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                            {% if form.error('authority') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('authority') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="一時的に非稼働にすることが可能です。必要ない場合はメンバー一覧より削除してください。">
                                            <span>稼働</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="有効にすると2段階認証でのログインが必要になります。2段階認証のデバイス設定をしていない状態でログインした場合、設定後にログインできるようになります。">
                                            <span>2段階認証</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('twoFactorAuthEnabled')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('twoFactorAuthEnabled') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('twoFactorAuthEnabled') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="c-conversionArea">
            <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                            <a class="c-baseLink"
                               href="/admin/member-list">
                                <i class="fa fa-backward" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>メンバー管理</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div id="ex-conversion-action" class="row align-items-center justify-content-end">
                            <div class="col-auto">
                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5"
                                        type="submit">{% if is_edit %}登録{% else %}登録{% endif %}</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

    {% if message is defined and message %}
        <p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ message }}</p>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
